ent as a causal factor -- General principle illustrated in Russian painting -- Internal aspect of technical activity -- Regularities in material dictate mode of approach -- Creating social values by social effort -- Two distinct statistical group activities -- Labor power and control power -- What is produced -- How the product is divided -- What happens to the unconsumed commodities -- Expand or die -- Finance -- What settles wages -- Stress at the interface -- The coming of economic crisis; must it be periodic? --^","Where is this market? -- The external contradiction -- Resolving difficulties by abstractions -- University and diversity among employers -- The chaos spreads -- Fascism, the final stage of frustration -- Inevitability -- Other times other phases -- Other countries -- Effects of uneven employment -- Invariable order in phases -- Telescoping phases by conscious group action -- Uneven development merely internal strains and stresses in society as a whole -- The negation of capitalism -- The two alternative routes -- The superstructure of society -- The social history of the theory and practice of probability -- The struggle on the ideological plane -- The search for the social variables -- What it means for you and me, or the unity of theory and practice -- Our present discontents -- The case for the classless society -- Unity of theory and practice -- Illustrated in the process of discovery -- Illustrated in planned activity -- Illustrated in desires and valuations --^","Society unconscious of the linkage -- Illustrated in thought activity -- Illustrated ideologues of society -- Its meaning for strategy -- What is truth?"],"note":[{"@type":"statement of responsibility","#text":"by H. Levy."},"\"First American edition.\""],"subject":[{"@authority":"lcsh","topic":"Metaphysics"},{"@authority":"lcsh","topic":"Socialism"}],"classification":[{"@authority":"lcc","#text":"B1646.L483 P5 1938a"},{"@authority":"ddc","#text":"192.9"}],"relatedItem":[{"@type":"othe